OL,3,GNEWSA'Pottery liberates me from MND
OL,4,Asymptoms'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has taken up pottery finds
OL,7,Fthe craft "liberating" since developing
OL,8,Fa rare form of motor neurone disease
OL,9,F(MND).
OL,11,FLinda Mace, from Winterslow, in
OL,12,FWiltshire, was diagnosed in 2023 with
OL,13,FPrimary Lateral Sclerosis (PLS) - a
OL,14,Fslower progressing form of MND that
OL,15,Faffects mobility.
OL,17,FShe took up pottery two years ago when
OL,18,Fone of her sons bought her sessions at
OL,19,Fa studio. Since then, the charity MND
OL,20,FAssociation, has supported her hobby
OL,21,Fthrough its wellbeing fund.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
