OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Pottery liberates me from MND
OL,4,Asymptoms'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMace said because MND damages upper
OL,7,Fmotor neurons which carry messages from
OL,8,Fthe brain and spinal cord to the body,
OL,9,Fdoing a slow activities like pottery
OL,10,Fhas helped her manage her movements and
OL,11,Fit gives her "purpose on that day".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
